# ---- Third-party content packs ----
# 1.38 GB of redistributable Fab packs, excluded to keep this repo ~45 MB.
# A fresh clone will NOT open L_Forest until they are re-added from Fab under
# these exact folder names -- asset paths in the level are absolute (/Game/Art/...),
# so a renamed folder breaks every reference.
#
#   Content/Orasot_Bundle      992 MB
#   Content/VRS_LowPolyNature  233 MB   forest foliage
#   Content/VFX_Bundle_2       158 MB
#   Content/Art                 96 MB
Content/Orasot_Bundle/
Content/VRS_LowPolyNature/
Content/VFX_Bundle_2/
Content/Art/

# ---- Private working notes ----
# Kept on disk, deliberately not published.
HANDOFF.md
NEXT.md
Docs/*
!Docs/CREDITS.md
refimages/

# ---- Local tool state ----
.claude/settings.local.json
.mcp.json

# Step-0 import probe -- throwaway, delete in the content browser
Content/Proto/Meshes/Probe/
